# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ExpenseTrack — Environment Variables (TEMPLATE)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kya karein:
#   1. Ye FILE (`.env.example`) GitHub pe rakhna — isme koi real value nahi hoti
#   2. Local development ke liye isse copy karke `.env` banao:
#        cp .env.example .env
#     phir .env me apni real values bharni
#   3. `.env` KABHI GitHub pe mat daalna (.gitignore ise block karta hai)
#
# NETLIFY / VERCEL pe deploy karte waqt:
#   .env file ka use NAHI karna — instead dashboard me daalna:
#     • Netlify → Site configuration → Environment variables
#     • Vercel  → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Wahi values daalno jo neeche likhi hain.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Aapke Supabase project ka URL
# (Supabase → Project Settings → API → "Project URL")
# Example: https://abcdefgh.supabase.co
SUPABASE_URL=""

# ⚠️ SUPER SECRET — ye key database ke saare security rules ke upar se
#    bypass ho sakti hai. Isliye:
#      • Sirf serverless function (delete-account) use karta hai
#      • Frontend (js/ folder) me KABHI mat daalna
#      • GitHub pe KABHI mat commit karna
#    (Supabase → Project Settings → API → "service_role" key)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""
